from ui_incremental import *
record(P+'ViewModels/PayrollViewModel.cs','Payroll run list/line display/create/transition/pay with retained DTOs.',[
('PayrollLineRow','Uses actual base/additions/deductions/advance/net; distinguishes unpaid/paid, preserves accounting labels rather than blending advances with payments. Display aggregates use unchecked long; server outputs expected bounded but validation separate.'),
('ReloadAsync','Reads actual runs, selects previous/newest; public Load refuses if CanEditAction false or payment dialog. Recovered transition/pay DTO makes CanEditAction false before list load, leaving SelectedRun null with no recovery context.'),
('LoadLinesAsync','Version increments and clears lines; discards stale response before EnsureEmployeeNamesAsync, but no version check after awaiting name read. Slow employee-name response allows old run lines appended into newer selection, potentially misleading payment amount display.'),
('EnsureEmployeeNamesAsync','Caches names after first successful roster fetch, no cancellation/version. Failure intentionally uses raw IDs; repeated failures repeat request per run. Nested await race above not covered by initial version guard.'),
('CreateRunAsync','YYYY-MM regex validates month, may accept Unicode \d year but server must enforce period. Pending create retry reachable independently of form/list; stable Guid frozen durable request.'),
('AdvanceRunAsync','CanAdvance depends NextStatus SelectedRun; recovered transition no selection => unavailable. Same-process unknown transition rechecks authoritative run monotonic StatusRank to reconcile keyless endpoint. Good intent, runtime source-only; UI label uses current NextStatusLabel not captured target.'),
('PayRunAsync','Requires IsPayOpen before checking recovered _payRequest; after restart false, OpenPay requires CanEditAction false so cannot restore. Source recovery dead-end analogous UI-005. Fresh account required and typed known accounts, server pays actual stored run authoritative total.'),
('OnIsBusyChanged','Registers pending only busy transitions; constructor recovers helpers but does not register initial session gate. Root nav can leave recovered page even though locally blocked. No explicit generic RetryAll recovery command in this file.')],
'Need concrete recovered transition/pay reconstruction test, delayed employee names cross-run version test, new period Unicode validity and server payment contract. No payroll writes executed.',
'Recover target run/dialog from original DTO with standalone retry; recheck generation after every await; protected per-owner pending registry.')
record(P+'ViewModels/EmployeesViewModel.Pay.cs','Standalone earned-balance employee payment.',[
('OpenPay','Uses editable employee row, prefill only positive balance, main default account, new ID once; negative balance accurately no amount due. Known accounts Main/Bank/InstaPay exclude drawer.'),
('SubmitPayAsync','Pending DTO branch before PayEmployee null, so core retry can execute without transient row; native button still hidden if dialog not restored. Fresh money positive<=shown balance; server cap must handle concurrency. Resolves real employees_ledger manager approval, optional reason.'),
('CompletePayAsync','Durable helper preserves exact ID/actor/amount across uncertainty; server balance-after used, closes row, clears requestId and reloads. Error text unknown handled helper. PIN field not explicitly cleared on close/success until next open, retaining sensitive string longer than needed.')],
'Need reconstructed payment dialog/retry reachability and concurrent updated balance tests. No employee payout performed.',
'Open recovered payment panel from retained employee identity; clear PIN fields on permitted close/resolution, keep server balance authority.')
record(P+'ViewModels/EmployeesViewModel.Report.cs','Employee financial report date presets, real line query and stale-read protection.',[
('ResolveReportRange','Explicit BusinessClock.Today Cairo, last7today-6,last10-9,monthfirst; custom DateOnly of picker; inverted range sorted. All-time remaining ledger balance documented separate from period flow.'),
('OnSelectedReportPeriodChanged','Updates custom/range and starts read if visible; custom date changes launch read but range label only explicitly updated inside loader. Good no silent DB mutation.'),
('OpenReportAsync','Requires editable state and reports_view; defaults real today. CloseReport increments version and clears data/error, invalidates pending response.'),
('LoadReportAsync','Each read snapshots version, only current response publishes and clears busy; protects date switch and closed report. Does not cancel network calls, so rapid picker changes still generate many wasted requests. No database writes.')],
'Need delayed report/version and preset boundaries tests, no native rendered table measurement. Correct good pattern for UI-007 comparison.',
'Reuse generation pattern for customer/recipe/payroll reads; add cancellation/debounce for large repeated queries while preserving latest state.')
record(P+'ViewModels/EmployeesViewModel.cs','Roster/balances/ledger and wage/overtime/extra-shift/cash-out actions.',[
('EmployeesViewModel','Owns real editor and Saved reload; caches _all real roster. Every employee balance fetched separately after list and settings: N+2sequential calls, noticeable large roster/10second timeouts, no batch endpoint in this UI.'),
('ReloadAsync','On balance failure stops and LoadError set; list cleared first so no false partial rows; overtime rate stays previous/default if settings read fails silently, preview may wrong while server rate authoritative.'),
('ReloadLedgerAsync','Version+row identity guard after fetch, Close increments version; correct delayed read isolation. Distinguishes empty from failed and allows read retry. AttendanceWorkflowTests cover these good paths.'),
('OpenAction','Sets known kind, employee, default amount/2hours, one request ID. Exposes no hard delete of employee or ledger. Requires shift only for physical drawer advance/withdrawal; earning accrual separate.'),
('SubmitCashOutAsync','Retries any existing typed pending first; fresh requires active employee context, shift when drawer, reason. Real approval. Daily wage has no client request ID in DTO, server idempotency must reconcile actual business key. Overtime and extra shift stable once per modal.'),
('CompleteCashOutAsync','Four completion methods each call correct durable helper/typed API; FinishAction records server outcome note, closes target and reloads. Source journal exists but constructor restores no CashOutEmployee dialog; public load blocked while any pending, all row actions blocked, so native retry reachability must be checked.'),
('CanEditAction','Blocks all5helpers pending, session registration only OnIsBusyChanged; initial reconstructed helper state not registered globally. Source-level recovery mismatch family, not proof duplicate actual salary.'),
('ResolveApprovalAsync','Single real manager PIN exchange when user lacks employees_ledger. Role page employees_manage separate permission may need approval, appropriate fallback.')],
'Need reconstructed each money-operation actual UI retry target, batch roster scaling and overtime preview missing-settings behavior. No financial write/employee data read from live backend.',
'Hydrate recovered action or show generic retry independent row; register pending immediately; batch/cancel roster reads; preserve earned accrual vs actual disbursement distinctions.')
record(P+'ViewModels/RecipesViewModel.cs','Recipe coverage/cost truth, ingredient editor and real save.',[
('RecipeRow','Unknown cost dash, partial floor prefixed from, margin returned server only; no invented zero cost. CostsHidden branch intentionally withholding money for author-only role, though placeholder DTO numeric zeros must stay hidden at all consumers.'),
('LoadAsync','Reports users fetch summaries+coverage, then ingredient list; author-only LoadWithoutCosts fetches plain recipes/menu and hides costs. Missing coverage sets LoadError, preventing falsely reassuring absence. Recipe selection detail always uses cost endpoint; author-only editing gate may fail if backend reports_view required, parent cross-check.'),
('ApplyFilter','Matches product/recipe/category and complete/unknown status. Hidden-cost placeholder KnownLineCount0means all appear unknown to filter despite costs merely unauthorized; text labels CostsHidden distinguishes row but filter semantics may confuse.'),
('LoadDetailAsync','No request generation/cancellation check; selecting A then B can publish slow A into B detail, including recipe edit target from Detail. This is real source race, cross-recipe save potential if operator starts editing inconsistent pane; no backend writes tested.'),
('OnDetailChanged','Rebuilds actual cost lines and all derived cost/margin/missing labels. Margins withheld when incomplete, correctly not zero. CostLineRow shows actual purchase/estimated/prep/circular provenance and missing reasons.'),
('StartEdit','Copies current Detail lines and preserves kind/yield conversion; requires menu_manage. CanStartEdit also nonediting, but direct StartEdit method no IsSaving guard; CancelEdit unconditionally discards while save in flight, no global pending gate.'),
('ApplyIngredientFilter','Active ingredients only, excludes chosen IDs, max60visible, client search. LoadIngredients caches successful list for VM lifetime; newly created stock items may not appear until new page.'),
('SaveAsync','Validates nonempty lines, positive milli-unit quantity. YieldRatioText accepts fractional via MilliUnits then integer /1000truncates, so1.5 becomes1 despite promise integer. Fresh Guid per submit, no retention; stale Detail target and unknown save invite wrong display or duplicate request. Server may upsert by recipe ID, not duplicate money, but inventory future consumption changed.'),
('RefreshSummaryAsync','Preserves selection via _reselecting, fetches real summaries/coverage. No error surfaced on failed summary refresh, keeps old list; old selection/detail mismatch can persist. No direct stock balance writes; recipe affects future checkout consumption backend.')],
'Need delayed A/B recipe detail with edit/save binding, author-only permission integration, fractional yield rejection, unknown-save identity and cancellation tests. No recipe changes made.',
'Version every selection response; enforce integer yield exactly; durable immutable saves and recoverable target identity; separate non-cost author detail from protected cost detail.')
